  "text": "The default output is:\n\n```text\n\u003ccommand name\u003e version \u003cVersion\u003e\n```\n\nfollowed by a newline. Specifically, `command.go:598-609`, `Command.VersionTemplate()`, falls back through parent commands and ultimately returns:\n\n```go\n{{with .Name}}{{printf \"%s \" .}}{{end}}{{printf \"version %s\" .Version}}\n```\n\nThus a command named `myapp` with `Version == \"1.2.3\"` produces `myapp version 1.2.3\\n`.",
